  ShadowDensity: 1.000000
  Text: |-
    Function Call Helper builds a panel of buttons at runtime, one for each function you list from your scripts.
    
    Pinch a button to call its function. The line at the top of the panel shows which function ran.
    
    Scroll the panel to see all nine example functions.
